{"text":"You remember the first weeks after the impact. A few dinosaurs made it through the fire too. One of them was a duck-bill. So thin you could count its ribs. It stood by the river every day, chewing on burnt branches. One morning, you found the last green fern in a wet hollow. You carried it to the river, broke your own rule, and walked right up to a dinosaur. Close enough to touch. You held the fern out.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["Y","o","u"," ","r","e","m","e","m","b","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","s","t"," ","w","e","e","k","s"," ","a","f","t","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","i","m","p","a","c","t","."," ","A"," ","f","e","w"," ","d","i","n","o","s","a","u","r","s"," ","m","a","d","e"," ","i","t"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","e"," ","t","o","o","."," ","O","n","e"," ","o","f"," ","t","h","e","m"," ","w","a","s"," ","a"," ","d","u","c","k","-","b","i","l","l","."," ","S","o"," ","t","h","i","n"," ","y","o","u"," ","c","o","u","l","d"," ","c","o","u","n","t"," ","i","t","s"," ","r","i","b","s","."," ","I","t"," ","s","t","o","o","d"," ","b","y"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r"," ","e","v","e","r","y"," ","d","a","y",","," ","c","h","e","w","i","n","g"," ","o","n"," ","b","u","r","n","t"," ","b","r","a","n","c","h","e","s","."," ","O","n","e"," ","m","o","r","n","i","n","g",","," ","y","o","u"," ","f","o","u","n","d"," ","t","h","e"," ","l","a","s","t"," ","g","r","e","e","n"," ","f","e","r","n"," ","i","n"," ","a"," ","w","e","t"," ","h","o","l","l","o","w","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","c","a","r","r","i","e","d"," ","i","t"," ","t","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r",","," ","b","r","o","k","e"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","o","w","n"," ","r","u","l","e",","," ","a","n","d"," ","w","a","l","k","e","d"," ","r","i","g","h","t"," ","u","p"," ","t","o"," ","a"," ","d","i","n","o","s","a","u","r","."," ","C","l","o","s","e"," ","e","n","o","u","g",